通过深度注意力完成图像合成。</p>\n        </div>\n        <figure>\n          <div class=\"placeholder hero-placeholder\">[Diagram: centered]</div>\n          <figcaption>Image Composition with Depth Regression</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <h2>背景</h2>\n        <div class=\"two-column\">\n          <div>\n            <p>图像合成是指将不同图像中的内容融合成一张具有真实感的图像。</p>\n            <p>已有的图像合成方法主要探讨色彩、阴影和噪声的和谐性。</p>\n            <p>图像合成通常需要真实的图像，也需要对图像进行细致的分割。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"figure-grid\">\n            <figure>\n              <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Photo: source image]</div>\n              <figcaption>(a) 源图像</figcaption>\n            </figure>\n            <figure>\n              <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Photo: target image]</div>\n              <figcaption>(b) 目标图像</figcaption>\n            </figure>\n            <figure>\n              <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Photo: composite image]</div>\n              <figcaption>(c) 合成图像</figcaption>\n            </figure>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <h2>方法</h2>\n        <div class=\"two-column\">\n          <div>\n            <h3>深度注意力</h3>\n            <p>本文提出新的方法，从源图像中选择需要融合的图像内容，并通过深度注意力进行处理。</p>\n            <p>深度注意力能够获得图像内容的深度信息，并根据深度信息完成图像合成。</p>\n          </div>\n          <figure>\n            <div class=\"placeholder diagram\">[Diagram: workflow from source image to output]</div>\n            <figcaption>(a) 源图像　(b) 差异模板　(c) 使用模板　(d) 目标-源图像块　(e) 细化　Output</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"figure-grid\">\n          <figure>\n            <div class=\"placeholder wide-photo\">[Photo: source image]</div>\n            <figcaption>(a) 源图像</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure>\n            <div class=\"placeholder wide-photo\">[Photo: 目标图像]</div>\n            <figcaption>(b) 目标图像</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure>\n            <div class=\"placeholder wide-photo\">[Photo: target-source image patch]</div>\n            <figcaption>(c) CompGAN 方法　(d) Tan's 方法　(e) PS　(f) 我们的方法</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <h2>实验结果</h2>\n        <div class=\"two-column\">\n          <div>\n            <h3>深度检测</h3>\n            <p>(a) 深度检测：根据目标图像需求，通过更细致的分割得到图像。</p>\n            <p>(b) 深度优化：根据编辑操作建立与来源内容相对应的深度信息。</p>\n            <p>(c) 迭代进行图像分割和深度的调整，实现图像合成。</p>\n          </div>\n          <figure>\n            <div class=\"placeholder chart\">[Chart: composition orders]</div>\n            <figcaption>Composition orders</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"figure-grid\">\n          <figure>\n            <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Photo: image composition example]</div>\n            <figcaption>(a) 图像合成</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure>\n            <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Photo: depth segmentation example]</div>\n            <figcaption>(b) 深度检测</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure>\n            <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Photo: result example]</div>\n            <figcaption>(c) 结果</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <h2>对比结果</h2>\n        <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n          <table>\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th rowspan=\"2\">Row</th>\n                <th colspan=\"5\">Accuracy</th>\n                <th colspan=\"5\">F1 Score</th>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <th>CompGAN</th>\n                <th>Tan's</th>\n                <th>PS</th>\n                <th>Ours</th>\n                <th>Our*</th>\n                <th>CompGAN</th>\n                <th>Tan's</th>\n                <th>PS</th>\n                <th>Ours</th>\n                <th>Our*</th>\n    